> > >     dem65 =~ y5 + y6 + y7 + y8
> > >   # regressions
> > >     dem60 ~ ind60
> > >     dem65 ~ ind60 + dem60
> > >   # residual correlations
> > >     y1 ~~ y5
> > >     y2 ~~ y4 + y6
> > >     y3 ~~ y7
