Hi Mariyam,
thanks for your interest! The Working Group on SEM is an informal group that meets usually once a year. We don't have any membership fees and we aren't officially associated with any other organizations. So unless the local organizers in a given year have obtained funding via sponsors, we usually aren't able to help anyone with travel costs.
Sorry about that!
Thanks and take care
Henrik

